# IMX round 4: Tape FX on a sample track. Instrument 1 becomes a looping sine, track 1 plays it on step 1 and a Tape run-down sits on step 5. The trace follows the voice of track 1: it starts, stops on the Tape step while the pattern runs on, starts again on the next pass (starts counts)
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini  (setup pokes in plus_flows.sh, the poke trace UISHOT_TRACE_FFSTATE is the read, poke_ok in plus_flows.sh)
title: Tape FX stops a sample voice (Tracker Mini, IMX round 4)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

wait 1500ms
tap Fn1
wait 3000ms
tap Play
wait 7000ms
shot tape-playing
tap Play
wait 1500ms
shot tape-stopped
